{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f70e49e9e90dc2c648a65fa7537cd11bbdf7ea86399a1a82ae366c0b50275531",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41b7487e8e0415c60d6070a82d2a4d4694a8f3c8b3bf7959d63b00143cc85761",
      "text": "想做的事，想试着做做看的事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a35cf6cd876529aea1cf3e1a01009ffc68d87bf63da11940f0dbbdb2d8289dc",
      "text": "“想商量一下这次演唱会的歌曲和歌词。\n如果有好点子的话请告诉我”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f234e356e67337a18a67d240754625e7a696575b5636c8d19de08a4248686355",
      "text": "虽然秀他们是这么来找我们商量的……\n大家觉得呢？有想到什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd589afc87df3603aef3887450cf4b6dddf69d200259eb8959393193650acf0",
      "text": "超级超级纠结啊！\n想尝试的事情多到不行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da2d4bb9a0c946d65fd7a9764ff9a12b7a0e6f3b21c428ffeb3b7173085991cb",
      "text": "我也是。要是把脑子里冒出来的点子全塞进去，\n演唱会的时间根本就不够用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c442941843454bd98022daa7705536f040ede4685aeca83f606ce5924e92a4d9",
      "text": "要是全盘托出对方也会很为难吧，\n至少先把提案的方向性缩小一点比较好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:160b743f2b909cb2557d37823fc0f24edca70e158d5454142a9712fc5ddfd91d",
      "text": "方向性啊……对了！\n315 Pro里有着各种各样的组合对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87714b7d68af69ae6c06f548e1923bca182c870ed8ed65c6c0ece6374b65bc17",
      "text": "既然这样，能体现出各个组合各自魅力的\n歌词，大家觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a540c063311aebadaf148407cf138ed70576210ed09acdbd211a987977886bee",
      "text": "那个……可能不错呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90f7e09fd10e0ad942d41116b1baec3fe637bc89587849da51eed56bec4d6e86",
      "text": "我我有想法！我想做成那种能让大家一起嗨起来的、\n超级热烈亢奋的歌曲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9da40fe231b0ccf380f6d90ff624a921893d8a1693a7ac14dd070aa1d334ee7d",
      "text": "对吧！拍手应援，加上呼喊应答（Call & Response）\n这种感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80b7fc22a0e9e71ba8758c407eae2825a67f8322dbc38b72546b303929049a60",
      "text": "嗨起来，是吗。\n既然这样，去问问神速一魂的意见如何呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8642d116f2405d348e9dbbd3eeba923d027c30e57e4261eab17fd28fe73a2d20",
      "text": "毕竟神速一魂现场的一体感非常厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:869692b49bbbcd771b485753eef7902e5272e930af13a271a2026851673ecca4",
      "text": "嗯……我也赞成……呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_002_22_5_06_002_22:5_06_002_22:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55a673a9d0efa9b72f183a7063a861b66b981afbc5ab90a0df56381e5526a668",
      "text": "那我这就用LINK去拜托他们。稍微等我一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
